  "translation": "Gomme o be a tlhokomela ⟨את⟩ Hadasa — ⟨ke⟩ Esterre, morwadie wa malome wa gagwe — gobale ⟨go⟩ ena le ga go tate le mma; gomme mosetsana yoo o be a le sebopego se sennyegišego gomme a le ponahalo e botse; gomme ge tate le mma wa gagwe ba hwile, Mordekai a mo tšea go yena bjalo ka morwadia.",
